      "product_summary": "Wide toe-box mesh sneakers with pointed triangular side windows and a double toe overlay. Two pull tabs give the wearer a grip when putting the shoe on. The angular panels and waved low sole create a distinct casual design in Black, Khaki and White.\nBlack, Khaki, White; EU 39-48 provide color and size choices for wholesale assortments.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Share footwear specifications, quantities, packaging needs and destination for review and quotation. Company images introduce company activities and order coordination."
